      <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-ink">Grams × 4</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body">Example: 200g × 4 = 800 kcal</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-4 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase text-mute">Fat calories</p>
      <p class="mt-1 font-semibold text-ink">Grams × 9</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body">Example: 67g × 9 = 603 kcal</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 id="complete-formula">Complete Macro to Calories Formula</h3>
  <p><strong>Total calories = (Protein g × 4) + (Carbs g × 4) + (Fat g × 9)</strong></p>
  <p><strong>Example:</strong> 150g protein + 200g carbs + 67g fat = (150×4) + (200×4) + (67×9) = 600 + 800 + 603 = 2003 total calories</p>

